# Env files.
#
# `.env` IS DELIBERATELY TRACKED — do NOT add `.env` back to this list.
# It holds only the PUBLIC api origin (VITE_API_BASE_URL) and is the sole place
# the deployed build can read it from: this project has no host-side env
# configuration. Untracking it once made the production bundle fall back to
# `http://localhost:4000`, which silently broke every API call and surfaced as a
# confusing CORS error rather than a missing-config error.
#
# Values that must stay private belong in `.env.local` (ignored below) or in the
# host's own environment settings.
.env.*
!.env.example
